 "words_heard": 232,
 "words": 237,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Next to Uzziel the goldsmith stood",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A perfumer with hands that could build",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "In the city of Jerusalem",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They worked side by side",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Restored the stone as far as the Broad Wall",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No one asked for glory or fame",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.1,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Just the task at hand in the dust",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.15,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Shoulder to shoulder in the rain",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.67,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hananiah son of Uzziel",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 1.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Building the wall with steady hand",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Next to him a perfumer stood",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.99,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Adding their part to the plan",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The gaps were closed the work went on",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Under the eyes of the Lord",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.89,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Sanballat and Tobiah grew furious",
   "heard": 1,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Seeing the gaps being closed",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They conspired to fight against Jerusalem",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.21,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To throw it into confusion and loss",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.14,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But we prayed to our God day and night",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Posting guards against their threat",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The laborers said the strength was failing",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Too much rubble on the street",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Hananiah son of Uzziel",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.57,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Building the wall with steady hand",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.49,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Next to him a perfumer stood",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Adding their part to the plan",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The gaps were closed the work went on",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Under the eyes of the Lord",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Enemies whispered we would be killed",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Before they saw the stone set",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But the Jews warned us ten times over",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We did not let our spirits get wet",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The nations around were afraid",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When the wall was finally done",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Fifty-two days the work was finished",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.08,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The enemies confidence was gone",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The wall stands firm in the history",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A testament to the strong",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.12,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  }
